    "text": "3 hours ago A UH-60 Alpha Plus Blackhawk helicopter — originally built for the Army, then fully rebuilt for firefighting — is heading into its 3rd straight year of wildfire response in your region. New this year, the PG&E-sponsored aircraft is now available through mutual aid to 6 surrounding counties, including Tehama, Plumas, Yuba, Sutter, Colusa, and Glenn. Read full article\n2",
